BT /F2 18 Tf 50 800 Td (Smart College Hub Backend Viva Questions) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 772 Td (Question list with direct answers for college backend presentation preparation.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 50 742 Td (Project Overview) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 58 722 Td (1. What is Smart College Hub?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 72 709 Td (Answer: Smart College Hub is a backend-supported college platform that helps students use) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 72 697 Td (features such as authentication, coding challenges, and collaboration in one system.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 58 680 Td (2. What problem does your project solve?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 72 667 Td (Answer: The project solves the problem of scattered student activities by keeping learning,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 72 655 Td (coding practice, and collaboration features in a centralized application.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 58 638 Td (3. What are the main backend modules?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 72 625 Td (Answer: Auth, token, coding challenges, collaborations, join requests, and memberships.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 58 608 Td (4. Why did you choose FastAPI?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 72 595 Td (Answer: FastAPI was chosen because it is fast, supports async programming, provides) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 72 583 Td (automatic API documentation, validates data using type hints, and is simple to structure.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 58 566 Td (5. What is the role of app/main.py?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 72 553 Td (Answer: It creates the FastAPI app, adds middleware, and registers all routers.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 58 536 Td (6. How is the backend connected to the frontend?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 72 523 Td (Answer: Frontend calls REST APIs exposed by FastAPI using HTTP requests.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 58 506 Td (7. What is a router in FastAPI?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 72 493 Td (Answer: A router groups related endpoints so the code stays organized.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 58 476 Td (8. Why did you separate routes, services, repositories, models, and schemas?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 72 463 Td (Answer: Separation makes the code maintainable, testable, and easier to explain.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 58 446 Td (9. Explain the request flow in your backend.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 72 433 Td (Answer: Request goes to route, route calls service, service calls repository, repository) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 72 421 Td (uses database, then response is returned.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 58 404 Td (10. What future improvements can be added?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 72 391 Td (Answer: Testing, deployment, rate limiting, better logging, notifications, and production) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 72 379 Td (security hardening.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 50 354 Td (FastAPI) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 58 334 Td (11. What is FastAPI?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 72 321 Td (Answer: A modern Python framework for building APIs quickly with automatic validation and) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 72 309 Td (docs.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 58 292 Td (12. What are the benefits of FastAPI?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 72 279 Td (Answer: High performance, async support, type hints, Swagger docs, and dependency injection.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 58 262 Td (13. What is an endpoint?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 72 249 Td (Answer: A URL path plus HTTP method that performs a backend action.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 58 232 Td (14. What is include_router\(\) used for?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 72 219 Td (Answer: It attaches route groups to the main FastAPI app.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 58 202 Td (15. What are tags in FastAPI?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 72 189 Td (Answer: Tags organize endpoints in the Swagger documentation.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 58 172 Td (16. What is Swagger UI?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 72 159 Td (Answer: The automatic interactive API documentation available in the browser.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 58 142 Td (17. What is dependency injection?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 72 129 Td (Answer: FastAPI automatically provides required objects like database sessions or current) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 72 117 Td (users.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 58 100 Td (18. What is Depends\(\)?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 72 87 Td (Answer: It declares a dependency that FastAPI should run before the endpoint.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 50 28 Td (Smart College Hub Backend Viva Questions | Page 1) Tj ET
endstream
