BT /F2 10 Tf 58 800 Td (106. What belongs in repositories?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 72 787 Td (Answer: Database create, read, update, delete operations.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 58 770 Td (107. How does this structure improve maintainability?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 72 757 Td (Answer: Each file has one responsibility and changes are easier to isolate.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 58 740 Td (108. How does this help testing?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 72 727 Td (Answer: Services and repositories can be tested separately.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 50 702 Td (Errors And Status Codes) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 58 682 Td (109. What is HTTPException?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 72 669 Td (Answer: FastAPI's way to return controlled HTTP errors.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 58 652 Td (110. When do you return 400?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 72 639 Td (Answer: Bad request or invalid input.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 58 622 Td (111. When do you return 401?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 72 609 Td (Answer: User is not authenticated or token is invalid.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 58 592 Td (112. When do you return 403?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 72 579 Td (Answer: User is authenticated but not allowed.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 58 562 Td (113. When do you return 404?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 72 549 Td (Answer: Requested resource was not found.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 58 532 Td (114. When do you return 500?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 72 519 Td (Answer: Unexpected server error.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 58 502 Td (115. How are expired tokens handled?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 72 489 Td (Answer: JWT decode catches expiry and returns 401.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 58 472 Td (116. How are invalid UUIDs handled?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 72 459 Td (Answer: The backend rejects them with an authentication error.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 58 442 Td (117. Why should error messages be clear?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 72 429 Td (Answer: They help frontend and users understand what went wrong.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 50 404 Td (Security) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 58 384 Td (118. How is your backend secured?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 72 371 Td (Answer: Password hashing, JWT auth, role checks, token blacklist, and environment secrets.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 58 354 Td (119. What if JWT secret is leaked?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 72 341 Td (Answer: Attackers could create fake valid tokens.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 58 324 Td (120. Why use .env?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 72 311 Td (Answer: To keep secrets and environment-specific settings outside source code.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 58 294 Td (121. Why is refresh token protection important?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 72 281 Td (Answer: Refresh tokens can create new access tokens.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 58 264 Td (122. What is token blacklisting?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 72 251 Td (Answer: Marking a token as invalid before its normal expiry.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10 Tf 58 234 Td (123. How can brute force login be reduced?) Tj ET
